  abilityName: Augur of Misery
  abilityDesc: 20 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    17 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP), 15 combo
    Dark attack on single foe (or probable 5% damage of foes' max HP), boosts spark
    damage (Dark) for 3 turns, probable spark critical for 4 turns & boosts own spark
    damage for 3 turns
